Package: fortanix-confidential-vm-blobs
Version: __VERSION__
Maintainer: Fortanix Inc <support@fortanix.com>
Architecture: amd64
Section: misc
Homepage: https://support.fortanix.com
Recommends: systemd-ukify
Description: Blob dependencies for use with the Fortanix VME Rust compiler target
 This package contains all required dependencies to allow executing the runner for the 
 Fortanix VME Rust compiler target with the default settings. Concretely, it bundles a 
 purpose-built kernel, OVMF firmware, init executable, and bootstub that are used by the 
 Fortanix VME runner to launch compiled ELF binaries as confidential virtual machines.
